---
// Technical-audience hero visual. Decorative; hidden in business mode via CSS.
---
<aside class="tech-only" data-animate>
  <div class="terminal" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="terminal-head">
      <span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span><span class="dot"></span>
      <span class="title">ms@solutions — bash — 80x24</span>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-body">
      <span class="line"><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="cmd">ms init</span> <span class="str">"new-product"</span> <span class="dim">--stack web,mobile,ai</span></span>
      <span class="line dim">→ scaffolding monorepo · pnpm + turborepo</span>
      <span class="line dim">→ infra: terraform + github actions</span>
      <span class="line"><span class="ok">✓</span> repo ready · ci/cd connected · 8s</span>
      <span class="line" style="margin-top:10px"><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="cmd">ms deploy</span> <span class="dim">--env=prod --cloud=aws</span></span>
      <span class="line dim">→ build · test · lint · type-check</span>
      <span class="line dim">→ docker: 3 images · ecs fargate</span>
      <span class="line dim">→ cloudfront · waf · observability</span>
      <span class="line"><span class="ok">✓</span> deployed to <span class="key">prod</span> in <span class="str">"2m 41s"</span></span>
      <span class="line" style="margin-top:10px"><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="cmd">ms status</span></span>
      <span class="line"><span class="key">uptime</span>: <span class="ok">99.98%</span>  <span class="key">p95</span>: <span class="str">"148ms"</span></span>
      <span class="line"><span class="key">cost</span>:   <span class="str">"-32%"</span> vs. último trimestre</span>
      <span class="line" style="margin-top:10px"><span class="prompt">$</span> <span class="cursor"></span></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>
